hash "hello" as "sha256" into digest
say digest
hash "hello" as "sha256" with key "k" into mac
say mac
data is bytes from text "hello"
d2 is sha256 of data
say hex from bytes d2
m2 is hmac sha256 of data using bytes from text "key"
say base64 from bytes m2
r is secure random bytes 32
say length of r
token is hex from bytes secure random bytes 16
say "token length" length of token
hash password "correct horse" and call it stored
say stored
if password "correct horse" matches hash stored
    say "match"
.
if password "wrong" matches hash stored
    say "bad"
otherwise
    say "no match"
.
generate encryption key and call it key
encrypt data using key and call it sealed
decrypt sealed using key and call it opened
say text from bytes opened
if d2 securely equals sha256 of data
    say "securely equal"
.
encrypt "secret text" with key "pass" into cipher
decrypt cipher with key "pass" into plain
say plain
random number from 1 to 6 into roll
say "roll" roll
